Tool response:
Tool: place_bid_on_lot
Description: Places a bid of the specified amount on the given lot ID. 
The bid must be higher than the current bid. 
This operation updates the lot's current bid and bid count.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "lot_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The unique identifier of the lot to bid on",
          "title": "Lot Id"
        },
        "amount": {
          "type": "number",
          "title": "Amount",
          "description": "The bid amount to place"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "lot_id",
        "amount"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: set_auto_bid_rule
Description: Creates or updates an auto-bid rule for the specified lot with a maximum bid amount. 
The auto-bid will automatically place bids up to this maximum if the lot is active and the user's bid is lower than the maximum.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "lot_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The unique identifier of the lot to set auto-bid rule for",
          "title": "Lot Id"
        },
        "max_bid": {
          "type": "number",
          "title": "Max Bid",
          "description": "The maximum bid amount for the auto-bid rule"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "lot_id",
        "max_bid"
      ]
    }
